Author: Dr. Thorsten Tepper Garcia

Date: 12 MAY 2020

About:

This subdirectory contains a number of patches
to files originally in amr.

units.f90:
- added km2cm conversion factor
- added scale_m
- automatically set scale_t when poisson=.true. to
	ensure that G=1 in user units for all gravity runs
- provide information to stdout about relevant units

